","value":"{}_{3}^{7}\\mathrm{Li} + {}_{1}^{1}\\mathrm{H}\\rightarrow{}_{Z}^{\\mathrm{A}}\\mathrm{Be}\\rightarrow 2\\mathrm{X}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n（1）已知 "},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{1}^{1}\\mathrm{H}"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{3}^{7}\\mathrm{Li}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、X的质量分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，光在真空中的传播速度为c，请写出核反应方程中的X的符号及该核反应放出的核能。\n（2）初始时开关 "},{"type":"math","value":"S"},{"type":"text","value":" 未闭合，橡胶带表面的电荷面密度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sigma"},{"type":"text","value":" ，若橡胶带上电荷全部充入金属球壳（电容为 "},{"type":"math","value":"C_0"},{"type":"text","value":" ）并且在加速器罩上维持 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的稳定电压，（a）假设经加速后的质子束进入偏转磁场后，产生了 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta = 60^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的偏转角。求偏转磁场的磁感应强度 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 的大小；\n(b) 求质子束的等效电流 I;\n（c）假设为加速器罩充电的橡胶带停止运行（即外部停止对加速器罩充电），闭合开关 "},{"type":"math","value":"S"},{"type":"text","value":" 则加速器上的电压将随时间衰减。设质子束的电流保持在 "},{"type":"math","value":"I_0"},{"type":"text","value":" ，加速器罩与金属环之间的电容、以及导线的分布电容均可忽略，求加速器罩上的电压从 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 减小 "},{"type":"math","value":"50\\%"},{"type":"text","value":" 所用的时间。假设在停止充电之前系统已达到稳定。（可能用到的数学公式： "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sum_{x_1}^{x_2}\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{A} + x}\\Delta x = \\ln \\frac{\\mathrm{A} + x_2}{\\mathrm{A} + x_1}"},{"type":"text","value":" （其中 A 为常数））\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/8dd55a340d2cb22d7b23c5ec667a8180d8d8a8321f57a986638c38a91aec6e65.png","width":900,"height":428,"width_mm":105.634,"row_group":"9-1-lianmeng-2511-q18-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（1）根据核反应方程满足质量数守恒和电荷数守恒，可知方程为"},{"type":"math","value":"{}^{7}_{3}\\mathrm{Li} + {}^{1}_{1}\\mathrm{H}\\rightarrow {}^{8}_{